#: dasha_desk/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "DESK"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/4
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hello! What can I do for you, my friend?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey, Dasha. Abel seemed a little down."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Are you sure? It takes a lot to upset him."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "He is always so kind and easy-going."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He was sighing a lot... and he told me to come talk to you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Poor Abel. He is always thinking of others and never himself."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have told him many times he should consider taking a suitor again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps that could be you?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Does he get a lot of suitors?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me? A suitor?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just want to make sure he's alright."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Why not you? You are lovely."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-3/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But if not you, there are always others."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-3/23/0/s/0 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-4/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are there a lot of others interested in Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That makes two of us, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It would have been nice to hear that he is considering love once again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Less and less over the years now, but yes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel has always been popular, even if he tries to keep others away."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What’s up with that?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Some objects have hurt him in the past."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I don’t think that is all."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "He has always preferred to be alone."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-3/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't get it, I feel like everyone I talk to says he’s so supportive."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "He is very supportive."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You need something done? Abel is there."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are hurting? Abel is there."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "As long as it is about you? Abel is there."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But when the attention is on him he is freezing up."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "As he would say, like hairless cat jumping into bucket of ice."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why, though?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Makes sense."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/c-7/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Why indeed? I do not fully understand his way of speaking."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-4/c-7/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I mean, yeah, that... but why does he freeze up?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah yes. I believe he is afraid."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Afraid? Of what?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really know him well, don't you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Of himself, perhaps. Or of loneliness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But he spends most of his time alone..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Being alone and being lonely are not the same thing."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel does indeed enjoy solitude."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I think, even when he is alone, Abel carries others with him."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The loneliness Abel fears is that of rejection."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To give so much of himself, freely, and have that thrown aside..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I think it would ruin him, and he is knowing it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Geez, right... guess he's not up for anything casual then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes. Nothing casual."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you want his heart, you must mean it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I know this: if you do pursue him, he will not let you down."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thanks, Dasha. This was really helpful."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-9/15/c-0/55/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Happy to help! Bye for now!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would like to think so after so many years."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is an honor to keep his confidence."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's not bad-looking either."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How come you two never dated?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You guys sure have a lot in common."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Not bad-looking? He is god in cowboy hat."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "He is magnificent."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you like him?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Me? I..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have just remembered I have many things to take care of."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-0/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Go take care of our friend, please. Do svidaniya!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel and I? I... I don't know."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps it never came up."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps he does not care for me in this manner."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It doesn't matter anyway. I only want his happiness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Go now, and make sure he's alright."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-1/47/0/s/0 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I suppose we do, don't we?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We walk a lonely road together."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Always lifting others, never being lifted ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It takes a strong table to carry so much on his shoulders all the time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If only he had someone to lift alongside him."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To help him with form. To celebrate his personal best."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Someone like you, maybe?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "M-me?! Why me!?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that not where this was going?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "N-no, I... I would never presume..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is about Abel, not me!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please, go to him now. Tell him it is time he took care of himself."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_conversation/0/g-5/c-10/23/c-2/55/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have... much to do."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Upon reflection it makes sense that your desk is as muscled and sturdy as she appears to you here now, but you still can't say you were expecting all this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/14
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She looks like she could snap you in half with a pinky, but also like she gives the most incredible hugs imaginable."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/22
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Aha! A stranger? I am Dasha! And you..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/30
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have quite the look on your face."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't think my desk would be, um..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You have a lot of muscles."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "... Can you pick me up?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Muscled from head to toe?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha! You are not the only one to be left speechless by Dasha's muscles."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do not be so surprised. It is only natural. After all..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I do! I am VERY good at hugging."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But they aren't just for hugging. All day long I am lifting."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-2/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Heheh. Of course I could. Would you like that?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-2/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "These muscles aren't just for show, after all!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-2/27/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoah! You weren't kidding... I haven't been picked up like this since I was a kid."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-2/27/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha never lies! My muscles are capable of lifting far more than your feather weight."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/c-2/27/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just like that... Dasha sets you down as gently as a feather."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Holding so much on my shoulders, day in, day out?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "My job demands muscular perfection!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That's enough about me, though! Tell me about yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have <i>intent</i> in your eyes. Have you come to ask me questions?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow, you're really perceptive."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to learn how to better converse with people."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was just clicking around and saw the desk."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I see much here through the day."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have become very good at reading people."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Your eyes might as well be question marks."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But listen to me go on. Speak, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well... I was hoping to revive my love life."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And you have come to Dasha to help you do this, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have come to the right place."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Tell me more."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I get nervous sometimes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm a bit inexperienced..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What makes you such an expert?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do not be nervous! I will help you train your heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The heart is, after all, a muscle too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And all muscles can be trained! Strengthened!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "With my guidance you will be swole on the inside."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That is no problem. Inexperience has an easy solution:"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Experience!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will get you sorted out in no time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have seen many things in my years."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Seen people come and go. Listened to their stories."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps Dasha has not had as many lovers as some others."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But my heart is stronger than most!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-3/39/c-0/31/c-2/42
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Trust me. I will help you get what you need."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah? I see! In that case, I will help you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There are three things we must do."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "First, we must help you learn to like yourself."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Second, we must get you experience speaking to others."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And third, we must HAVE FUN!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-4/50/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Marvelous! Let's begin!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "'Clicking around'? These are nonsense phrases."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You seem directionless. Bored. Without aim."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Allow Dasha to help!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not sure about this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All right. Let's begin!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Uncertainty is for loser who stays at home!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are FILLED WITH CERTAINTY!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Confidence is like muscle. It must be exercised."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let me hear you say you are ready- with CERTAINTY!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not though."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's DO THIS!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That is alright. We will work at it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will be certain in your stead."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-0/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come, I will help you practice."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "YES! That is the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you approach everything with enthusiasm you cannot lose!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-6/42/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let's do this!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is the spirit! You are winning already."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Pretend that I am the one who makes your heart flutter."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What would you say to me, hmm?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ARE the one who makes my heart flutter."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I need to go to the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Okay. Hello. A classic."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-8/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We must work on warmer opening, but it is a start."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha, ahh you are funny one. Great joker, you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Try again, seriously this time!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really don't think that could be you?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We are only just meeting, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It was very funny, really! But the time for joking is over now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh. Well, alright."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-9/29/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yipes!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are telling the one who makes your heart flutter you need to go to the bathroom?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Wait, perhaps you are carrying on passionate affair with Jean Loo?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "His music is not for everyone, but perhaps his rhymes make you feel warm inside?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wouldn't go that far."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He does, actually, but I'm not here to talk about him."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, who?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The toilet, of course!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not sure what I was expecting but alright, sure."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/c-2/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But fair enough, this is not about him. This is about you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-2/c-10/37/c-2/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us continue!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Okay, okay. Perhaps there is too much pressure."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps we must go back to basics."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We are side by side at tasteful bar. I am just your type."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You wish to impress me. How do you get my attention?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Crush my head between your thighs like a watermelon, mama."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nice muscles. Can you pick me up?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would you mind sharing your lifting regimen?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What!? Why would I do this!?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The thought alone makes my stomach churn like angry sea."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no. Bozhe moi, you need more help than I could have imagined."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But fear not, my friend. Dasha will fix you right up."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have things to attend to now, but perhaps you can return for another love lesson sometime, eh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/56/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I can come back later."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/56/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah man I totally didn't get your whole deal."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/56/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "See you then!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-11/56/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is yet time!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh, you would like that? Come here."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoah!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha lifts you ably with one hand, raising you high off the ground as easily as you might lift a pillow. She sets you down with a proud grin."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You seem to enjoy being lifted over my head like barbell."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I rather enjoy it myself, to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are like tiny feather! Lifting you is like lifting baby!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like there's probably a sexier way to say that."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is true, though. But perhaps you are right."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Wait, wait. What am I saying?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We are here to train YOU, not Dasha. We must focus!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/c-0/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Still, you have impressed me in our imaginary bar."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-12/21/c-0/47/c-0/42
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here is my number, attractive stranger."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-13/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ahh, I see you have excellent taste."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-13/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is truly nothing greater in life than the pursuit of gains."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/toiletjoin/c-13/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here is my number, fellow muscle enthusiast."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now the question is... will you know what to be doing with this number?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tear it into pieces and throw it at you like so much confetti."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I carefully fold it and put it into my pocket, then call you after a reasonable amount of time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I call you right away."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi... you are in dire need of my help."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-14/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do not fear, my friend. Dasha will fix you right up."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-15/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes! Tasteful. Classy. Excellent."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-16/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Wow... you do not play games."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-16/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I never thought I would meet someone who feels the same as me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_introduction/0/g-3/c-16/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have earned yourself date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_good/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Excellent work today. Come meet me another time if you wish to continue your lessons."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_good/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have much work to do, but I have enjoyed our time together here."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_good/0/16/s/0 dasha_desk/post_bowling_good/0/27/s/0 dasha_desk/post_strip_good/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See ya."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_good/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "See you next time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Maybe not so much good feeling from you yet. We try next time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must be more open-minded."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Forget what you knew about love and open your mind to Dasha's teachings."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do better next time!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will make sure you are ultimate dater by the time we are finished."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_goodbye_bad/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Da!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha is lifting an enormous stack of papers over her head standing on one leg, barely breaking a sweat. She drops them as soon as she sees you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/14/b/4
msgctxt "Penelope"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha. How's it going?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is going EXCELLENT now that you have arrived!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "After all, today we have practice date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The thought of going on a date with you makes me happy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Calm down please."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really are passionate about helping others, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Even if it is fake date?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That is... nice to hear."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have not heard these kinds of gentle words in some time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-0/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, blin... you are making me blush."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-0/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Which means it is TIME FOR SUBJECT CHANGE!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am perfectly calm, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps it is you who should pump it up a bit, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But enough of this. We have more important things to discuss!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Most certainly! There is no greater joy in life."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/25
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If there is one thing I have learned from dear Abel, it is that helping others is a great way to ignore the sadness within you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What sadness?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't sound healthy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that really what Abel would want you to do?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You think because I am strong I am not able to feel sadness?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That because I smile I do not cry into my pillow at night?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If you pinch Dasha does she not shout, \"HEY!\""
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am just as human as you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "So human, in fact, that even when you are hurting my feelings, I am still going to be helping you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-0/53
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "So let us begin our practice date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Eh, perhaps it is not, but it is the only way I know how to deal with things."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Well, that, and a good session at the gym!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But since I cannot go to gym right now, we will focus on you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-1/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dasha..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-1/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "SO LET THE PRACTICE DATE BEGIN!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What Abel would want? Why are we speaking about what Abel would want?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You did bring him up."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You really seem to value his opinion."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're right, screw that hunk of wood."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Of course I do. Don't we all?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel is beloved by the entire house for a reason."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "He is kind, smart, supportive, handsome..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/35/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I see."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/35/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you mean by that, hmm?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/35/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Why are you looking at me like this?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/35/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no, no! We are wasting time that is meant to be used for your date training!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-1/35/c-0/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That is enough of that. Come! Come! Date time is now!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "NYET! YOU WILL NOT SPEAK ABOUT HIM THAT WAY!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No one tells me what to do."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry Dasha, I was just joking."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "HE IS GOOD TABLE WHO DOES NOT DESERVE SUCH HARSH WORDS!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... I am so, so... angry!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please leave before I say something I will regret!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-0/34/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/56/0/s/0 dasha_desk/post_restaurant_bad/0/32/s/0 dasha_desk/post_bowling_bad/0/35/s/0 dasha_desk/post_strip_bad/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh-ho, it is like that, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Tell yourself what to do then. I will be going now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "See if I care how your love life goes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-1/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I cannot do this now, I am too upset. Go!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-1/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do svidaniya!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I do not like this joke!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A joke starts with, 'knock knock! who's there!'"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It does not begin with attacking good and kind table!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am sorry, but I am too upset to continue your practice just now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I must lift something heavy at once. Go now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/56/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Mac!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/56/c-0/7/b/12
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Yello."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/56/c-0/7/b/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We lift!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/c-0/23/c-2/36/c-2/21/c-2/24/c-2/56/c-0/7/b/31
msgctxt "Mac"
msgid "Wooohoo!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Alright. Here we are on our first date. Where have you chosen to take me?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The bowling alley."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The strip club."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A restaurant."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah yes, the bowling alley!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The sound of the ball striking the pins..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The shine of the grease upon the floor..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The smell of years and years of cigarettes and pizza..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Is there any more romantic place?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-1/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Off we go then, in our imaginations, to the bowling alley!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps I am not hearing you correctly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I could have sworn I heard you say you are taking me, your imaginary date, to strip club."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A place where people are taking their clothes off for money all around you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Have I misheard you, my friend?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No you have not."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh. Alright. The strip club."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...bozhe moi. Well, let us... go to the strip club, then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-2/39/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "In our minds."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-3/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ahh, a restaurant! Yes, yes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-3/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A classic for a good reason."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-3/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We will gaze into each other's eyes across the table and feel the sparks!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_encounter_1/0/firstdate/c-3/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come then. Let us go to restaurant in our imaginations."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You return after having upset me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do you wish to make it up to me by going on very romantic practice date?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Or do you wish to be a little xyй?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's a xyй?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, let's have some fun, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, I'm a little xyй."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Something not very nice to say in polite company."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, there we go."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_angry_return/0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Very much so!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/9
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here we are. Shall we share appetizer, dear date?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't share food."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah, that's the best part."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That pretty smile is all the appetizer I need."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You do not share food?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I suppose next you will tell me you do not enjoy rainbow after storm."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Or the silken cheeks of chubby little baby."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't say all that. I just like my own food."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You're not impressing your date like that! But let us go on."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, excellent. The first step in impressing your date is to be generous."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha is impressed! So far, anyway."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-1/29 dasha_desk/the_bowling_alley/0/g-0/c-4/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us move on."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Eh? Pretty smile?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps you are meaning someone else?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you see anyone else here?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This imaginary restaurant is filled with people."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Like herring in the barrel, as my father always said."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps our waitress has impressed you with her pretty smile?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm talking to you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh. Well..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you blushing?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "W-well, that is one way to impress your date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But sharing appetizer is also excellent way to get close."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/c-2/37/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Whew. Let us move on!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Our food has arrived, and I am eating my steak with great enthusiasm."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you do next?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I take your baked potato while you're distracted."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I ask if you'd like to try some of my pasta."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tell the waiter it's your birthday."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "BETRAYAL!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no, no! This is WORST choice!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Stealing a desk's potato is tantamount to war!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Are you failing on purpose? It feels like you are failing on purpose."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You may ask to share, but never, ever, ever steal your partner's food!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-3/56
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Can you imagine if I was not here to help you? Shameful!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dah! That is the way."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-4/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is no greater joy than gazing lovingly into your date's eyes and taking bite of food from their plate."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-4/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Romance! Spark! Sensual generosity!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-4/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Top marks!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You mean... everyone in restaurant will turn their gaze to Dasha and sing and clap?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And there will be... free cake?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...I need a moment."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The thought brings tears to my eyes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes, yes. Very good. Excellent move."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/53
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Who does not love being the center of very loud and intense attention?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-0/c-5/61
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Truly you cannot fail with the birthday move."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And now, our final question."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The waiter walks in with bill and sets it on table between us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/16 dasha_desk/the_strip_club/0/g-0/8 dasha_desk/dasha_love_crit/0/g-1/8 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_crit/0/g-2/8 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you do?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I already paid the bill while you were in the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Challenge you to an arm-wrestling match for it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I beg you to pay it with tears in my eyes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh. It is like that, is it?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You think you are faster than Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You think you have gotten the better of me?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have started down dark path, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "One you are not prepared for, I think."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Dasha, this isn't real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The date is not real, but the slight to my honor is very real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Watch your back. When we dine together next... you are in for it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Was it good, though?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What? Wha- uh. Yes, yes. Uh, technically."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I mean, no, no, it is good."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I-I just... ungh, I do not like to lose in this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-6/53/c-0/26/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us move on. If we dwell on this I will become angry again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Important question: who pays?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The winner."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The loser."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-0/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now that's what I'm talking about... that is the way."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "A glorious battle for the right to pay the check..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-0/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi. It makes my heart race just thinking about it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-0/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now, that, THAT is the way to end a date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No. No!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You were so close. You almost had it perfect."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Instead you have ruined it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "The entire date is a waste."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Shameful. Just shameful."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-7/21/c-1/53
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is as if you have learned nothing from me all this time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have asked me on a date with no intention to pay?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now I am questioning if you were into me at any point..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-8/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Or if you are simply here for free food."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/a_restaurant/0/g-1/c-8/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This date is over!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/post_restaurant_good/0/3 dasha_desk/post_bowling_good/0/3 dasha_desk/post_strip_good/0/3
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Very good. You are becoming quite the charmer."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/post_restaurant_good/0/11 dasha_desk/post_bowling_good/0/11 dasha_desk/post_strip_good/0/11 dasha_desk/dasha_mid_not_ready/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
