#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Not yet. Forgive me, but my mind is storm of confusion."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I need time to make sense of it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Only cure for such feelings is lifting many heavy things."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come back to me another time and I will share my thoughts then."
