#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/41
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "More help than anyone can provide."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/49
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have never in my life said these words, but you are lost cause."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/58/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nooo..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/59/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes! I love trolling you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/crit_dasha_hate_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Go now and for the love of God do not ask anyone out. I beg of you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah. It is you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...I am fine. I was only thinking of private matter."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I expect you are here to continue date training, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I promised I would help you, and Dasha does not break her promises."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "So let us see this through... even to the bitter end."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tch. Whatever."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have had a terrible night together. One disaster after the other."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And yet, for some reason, hope springs in me."
