#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I decide to give you second chance."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-0/c-2/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are already making me regret second chance!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now we stand at my door. Somehow, even after all that, the air between us is thick with romantic tension."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Some part of me is beginning to think I have judged you too harshly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are DETERMINED to ruin our date!"
