#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-3/0/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This is... unexpected. But."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_crit/0/g-3/1/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am surprised. But."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh! There you are."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha. You ready to chat now?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes. Thank you for your patience with me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/15 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Spending so much time with you speaking of romance lately..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/23 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It has given me much to think about."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/31 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps it will surprise you that a strong and cheerful desk like myself is not going on many dates these days."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/39 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Truth is, I have put so much of myself into helping others, I have not left much time for myself."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/c-0/47 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "...no, no, Dasha. Do not lie to this wonderful human."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I thought it would sound nicer if this were the case, but it is not so."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/8/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But- but, the kiss we shared, it was real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/9/b/1
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But the feelings I have for you are real."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel for you too, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Interesting... but I'd rather just be friends if that's okay."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, what about Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Truly?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Truly."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah ah!! I...I have found love at last! No more lonely days!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/18 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I give you big kiss. Big hug. Big lift!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am so happy... I never imagined I could find love right here at home."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/34 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Who would have thought that you were seducing me all this time?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel like it might have been the other way around, but who's counting?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Either way! We have been practicing dating each other all along."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/15 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But it doesn't feel like practice, really."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-1/15/c-0/42/c-0/23 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "We have only done what is natural."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "This... this is comparatively more disappointing to me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I accept your friendship."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I think you are right."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have been such a wonderful friend to me and I would hate to lose that."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/39 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you for hearing me out, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/47 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Our dating lessons are officially over."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/55 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Next time we meet I hope you will tell me some good news about your love life!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/63/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Me too. Thanks, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-2/63/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It has been honor, friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What about Abel?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think you two would be a good match."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hm. I might be thinking so too, but this Abel, he does not seem to ask me to be his lover."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Abel is a little shy..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe you should ask him?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No, no! I am very much traditional desk built in traditional way! To ask out another? No. This is Table's job. Not mine."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_end/0/duschend/c-3/21/c-0/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "For now, I repeat."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_joiner/31
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "You failed the dating simulator... impressive feat! Keep up the good work."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You ready to chat now?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am. You are most kind to wait on me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/48/s/0 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tell me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is someone out there who has my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I do not think it will ever happen for us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Your friendship has allowed me to make peace with this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps I am not meant for heart-stopping love affair."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But I think I can be good friend to my friends."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And this is enough."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're talking about Abel, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mon. You can tell me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... am talking of Abel the Table, yes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't you just ask him out?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-4/15/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No! I am very much a traditional desk built in a traditional way! To ask out another, this is Table's job. Not mine."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I... am talking of Abel the Table."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-2/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, I've got something to say about that..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll be here to support you through your journey to find the one for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Give up on him. I'm the best one for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "That means much. Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course. Come on, let's go cheer you up. Maybe lift something?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will lift YOU."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/18 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha lifts you swiftly, tossing you into the air and catching you like an infant. She holds you over her head, grinning."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/26/0/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "WHOOOAH!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-7/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha! You lift burdens from my shoulders, and I lift you over my shoulders. We are excellent team."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/13
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Please, do not ask this of me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You mean much to me. But I do not think we share the same kind of feelings for each other."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are like sunshine. And it sounds like in your eyes I am burning flames of passion."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right. But if you don't feel the same way..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, I don't think so."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You understand, yes?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course. I'm just happy to have you in my life, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What a relief."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaha! You lift my burdens from my shoulders, and I lift you over my shoulders. We are excellent team."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You... cannot decide this on your own."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Do not test my friendship in such a manner. This makes me wobble in an ungainly way."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I really don't want this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have wobbled."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_end/0/g-3/c-8/48/c-1/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now I fall."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Here you come, ready to ruin the day of everyone you meet."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Or perhaps you are only so rude to Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell's your problem?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You! You are my problem!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have spent hours of my time trying to help you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "And you have spat in my eye at every turn!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have NEVER regretted helping a friend until now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But perhaps this is the problem."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You are not my friend. You never were."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That seems needlessly harsh."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never liked you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Your loss, weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "YOU are needlessly harsh!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-0/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me now. I have nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "How lucky for you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Unfortunately for me, I did like you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It seems only one of us is hurt in this relationship."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But no more. Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-1/39 dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/47
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have nothing more to say to you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No. It is no loss, at all."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But it is <i>your</i> loss."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha is wonderful friend, excellent lover."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/31
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But you will never, ever, EVER know this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_end/0/c-0/55/c-2/39
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have not spoken to Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Don't look at me like that!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "It is Abel who must find me anyway!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Speak with him if you insist on bringing us together."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_abel_crush_return/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Remind him of table's duty. Sell him on Dasha's many good points."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah... there you are, my beloved."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/9/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C'mere, Dasha. Gimme a lift."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/10/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh, nothing... sometimes I just feel as if there's something missing in my life."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But that is not on you. You are my angel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I just wish I knew what is making me feel this way..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear it. Can I cheer you up?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Seeing you is enough."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But hug and kiss might help."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come here, then."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha pulls you into a hug that warms you from head to toe, pressing a soft kiss to your lips."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ahhh... wonderful. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You always calm storm in my mind and heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's my honor, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/23/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now go, go! Before I melt into puddle!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_return/0/c-1/7 dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You always know how to make me feel better."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are, friend! It is always so good to see you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Great to see you too, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh, nothing. I had hoped seeing you might help cheer me up, but..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I suppose it's something I must figure out on my own."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I cannot shake feeling something is missing."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't help?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But this is not your problem. Only Dasha's."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_return/0/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Have a nice day. For both of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/8
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Didn't do enough damage before?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Perhaps you are hoping to finish the job?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live here, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not at all. Can't we just start over? (USE POISE CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Unfortunately for all of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Leave me alone."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yikes. Bye."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Yes. A new beginning."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha holds too much on her shoulders to hold onto grudge with you too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Let us leave such unpleasantness behind us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Friends again?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_hate_return/0/c-1/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/4
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hello! You have arrived just in time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh boy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's about time."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Let them talk.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have been trying to complete set for the last twenty minutes but... I am losing count."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "My mind is like wind whirl..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Maybe I could help you keep count?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha drops the weights she was in the middle of lifting with a loud, terrible sound."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/48
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!? Oh, bozhe moi... I have dropped weights."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/56
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Like insufferable lout at gym!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/64
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Here, let me..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/72
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "No no, I will..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/80
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Abel and Dasha both bend down to pick up the weights, their hands brushing as they do. Their eyes meet, and each pauses, frozen in place."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/107
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Your hands are real soft, you know."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/115
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like a well-maintained leather saddle."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/123
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I'm not sure this is compliment exactly..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/c-0/131
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "But you make me blush all the same, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Whew. Alright, alright."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I been dancin' around my feelin's for you for too long now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Feelings? Feelings of... friendship?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I don't know about you, but I ain't never wanted to kiss my friend in an intimate place."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/43
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I'm sorry if I'm embarrassin' ya, but I ain't sorry about my feelings."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/51
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Dasha... no one gets me like you do."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/59
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Nobody else in this house knows how hard it is to carry everyone else's burdens on your shoulders."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/67
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You do it without ever askin' for a thank you. Ya do it just cause it's right."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/75
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And WHILE ya do it, you look so gosh dang gorgeous!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/86
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Like a sunrise made 'a flowers and rainbows."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/94
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh Abel... you really have way with words."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/102
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Like... ah... typewriter... used by dictionary."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/110
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Aw shucks... that's the nicest thing anyone's ever said to me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/118
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "D'you think it'd be alright if I... if I kissed ya?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/126
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would like nothing more..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/134/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Get a room, you two."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/135/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You know I'm still here, right?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/136/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Awww."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh! I am so sorry, I... I forgot where I was."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/18
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I intend to."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/26
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Abel!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/34
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I told ya I'm done dancin' around my feelin's. I love you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/45
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...always have."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-4/56 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/23 dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/34
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I love you too..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I do, and I'm sorry... I just need to say this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I love you, Dasha. Always have."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Glad you don't mind, but I ain't doin' this for nobody's approval."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I just gotta say one more thing."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_dasha_meet/0/g-0/c-6/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I love you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/0 dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/0
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And you know what? This human living in this house made it all possible."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/8 dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/8
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I noticed your shenanigans getting us together... and I'll be damned if I didn't like it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's amazing. I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wasn't expecting that, just wanted to be friends with you, Abel!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "That's the spirit. Always room for one more between all our arms."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "...I love you, too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_love_divert/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Fine with me!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/abel_friend_divert/16
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank you, friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What does this mean for us, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so happy for you Dasha... you deserve this."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Dasha's heart is big enough to love both of you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "My life will be complete with both of your love."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you still want me too?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Of course! If you will have me..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I could never let you go, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I ain't threatened by nothin'. If Dasha loves you then I'm happy for you both."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "We can all be happy now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I couldn'ta gotten here without your love, you know."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You taught me I deserve to be happy too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And bein' happy for me means havin' both of y'all at my side."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so glad to hear that, Abel."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "If Abel loves you too then this only makes my heart glad."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/47/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To love table whose heart is big enough to love you and I at once... I cannot ask for better."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you, my friend. I could not have done this without your support."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No no, this was all you two. I'm just happy to be here to see it."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Thank ya kindly, my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Happy days ahead for all of us."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah! But don't let me keep you two."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "You're right. Dasha, if you'd like to... I'd be honored to take ya on a real date."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I would love to..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Thank you again for your support. Abel... let's go."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_ending_sort/0/6/c-1/15/c-0/23/c-0/31
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "I tip my hat to ya, friend. See ya around."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And Dasha... wanna love me for bringing you together?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_figure/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We make a great team, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are! The person responsible for my happiness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am so happy to have Abel, and so happy to call you friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Come, let me hug you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha throws her arms around you, squeezing you just a little bit too tight."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ooof! I think you might have cracked a rib..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/36/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Hahaa, apologies my friend."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am just so grateful."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I hope you are having wonderful day."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's always a wonderful day when I run into you, Dasha."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take care of yourself, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You too."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/10
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "There she is... the prettiest desk in the house!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Oh you!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Looks like it's time for me to hit the old dusty trail."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_friend_abel_return/0/c-0/31/c-0/15/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "'Preciate the privacy, partner."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/3
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There you are! One half of my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/11
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "And here comes the other half now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/19
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have both come to see me at once?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am not sure my heart can withstand such happiness."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/35
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "It's gonna have to withstand a whole lot more'n both of us comin' to say hi."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/43
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Bozhe moi... I am only humble desk."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/54
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You must take it easy on me."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's way more fun to fluster you."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Ain't it? I like the cut of your jib."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I am truly luckiest desk in world."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're the lucky ones."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_abel_return/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Abel"
msgid "Darn tootin'."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Realize? <i>Me</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/17/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/18/s/0 dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Ah, no problem at all."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_join_solo/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Only return to me when you are ready."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "You have returned! Does this mean you are ready?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Take your time—I will be here."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Dasha - can you be the one to lift our spirits and make sure this Realization thing works?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Dasha, let's do one big lift together! Hup!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a desk, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha's impressive muscle is all the more striking when she's given human form—there's a vitality to her now, a warmth and depth that radiate from deep within."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She's the same Dasha you've come to know, but this Dasha is <i>human</i>, and now capable of giving you absolutely life-changing hugs."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She doesn't even take a moment to inspect herself or let her transformation sink in before she's charging up to you and lifting you into her arms."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I have been realized! I am human!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/38
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I can hug now like never before!"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I feel so fulfilled..."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is hugging <i>really</i> all you want to do, Dasha?"
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "As do I. Thank you for this gift."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I will make you proud... just wait."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just like that, the energy between the two of you shifts. Dasha draws back just enough to look into your eyes—in hers, you see the promise of a love that's unlike any other... and in her touch you feel your impending ruin."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/11
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "There is much I want to do with you, beloved... you have only to ask."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm asking now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Then I am doing now."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha whisks you away in her strong, loving arms, and that night you are loved as you've never been."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Newly human and now alone together, Dasha shows you her truest, most vulnerable self—she may have once been a desk, but here she's only a woman, soft and loving and deserving of the world."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The dateviators certainly reflected her inner beauty, but there's a depth of connection between you now that can only be built from this kind of tender intimacy."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Still, when the two of you lie in bed together, even as she holds you close she seems at times distracted or even sad."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_divert/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you try to ask her what's on her mind, she only thanks you for choosing her, for showing up when she needed you most."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Without anyone around to demand Dasha's constant support, she's able to focus on finding what makes her happiest—and she finds she's happiest in the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Dasha takes great joy in cooking for and feeding others, and she comes by the house often with baked goods and covered dishes."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "When you ask Dasha why she makes so much at a time, she gets that sad look in her eyes again."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/24
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "I make so much to heal the pain in my heart."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/32
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "To fuel my muscles, yes... but they only need so much."
msgstr ""

#: dasha_desk/dasha_love_join/40
msgctxt "Dasha"
msgid "Now please... let us eat."
msgstr ""
